        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>洛必达法则与拉格朗日中值定理</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .band {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 155px;\n    height: 400px;\n    background: #f4f8fc;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 200px 40px 0 40px;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 2.2;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 22px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n  .item-no {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -22px;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .spaced span {\n    margin-right: 14px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"band\"></div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"indent\">\n      $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a} f(x)=\\infty$ 及 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a} g(x)=\\infty$ ;\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n      那么 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{f'(x)}{g'(x)}=l$ .\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n      洛必达法则可处理 $\\dfrac{0}{0}$ , $\\dfrac{\\infty}{\\infty}$ , $0\\cdot\\infty$ , $1^{\\infty}$ , $\\infty^{0}$ , $0^{0}$ , $\\infty-\\infty$ 型.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n      <span class=\"bold\">备注:</span> 若条件符合,洛必达法则可连续多次使用,直到求出极限为止.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item indent\" style=\"margin-top:26px;\">\n      <span class=\"item-no\">57、</span>拉格朗日中值定理:\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-left:44px; margin-top:10px;\">\n      若函数 $f(x)$ 满足如下条件: &nbsp;$f(x)$ 在闭区间 $[a,b]$ 上连续; &nbsp;$f(x)$ 在开区间 $(a,b)$ 内\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-left:44px; margin-top:6px;\">\n      可导,则在 $(a,b)$ 内至少存在一点 $\\xi$ ,使得 $f'(\\xi)=\\dfrac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}$ .\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
